272
00:14:50.822 --> 00:14:51.789
Saludos →

273
00:14:51.823 --> 00:14:53.085
de Ezri.

274
00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:54.149
Saludos →

275
00:14:54.192 --> 00:14:56.217
